    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "ECS Fargate infrastructure \u00b7 Singapore",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**banking-dev** \u00b7 ECS Fargate service and its Application Load Balancer \u00b7 CloudWatch, 60-second buckets.\n\nCPU and memory are service utilization percentages of allocated task resources, including the sidecar. Healthy targets measure ALB readiness, not ECS desired/running task counts. Latest values can lag by a few minutes. Sparse request/error metrics may show **No data** when AWS publishes no samples; gaps are not filled with zero. Container Insights is disabled; per-task network/storage metrics are not collected."
      }
    },
